{
  "header": {
    "description": "Is it WHERE the mover head looks? Head patching found one head, L12 H28, that carries 'today' to the last token. This swaps only that head's attention PATTERN at the last position from the counterfactual prompt \u2014 its values stay the base's \u2014 for every head of layer 12. All weekday names are one token here, so every pair is laid out identically, which the compiler checks. Needs eager attention."
